<title>USA: St Francis, Wis., won by John G Kinnard.</title>
<headline>St Francis, Wis., won by John G Kinnard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G Kinnard &amp; Co, Inc said it won $1.330 milli on of St Francis, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 4.60 percent.</p>
